<title>SPAIN: Spanish Treasury sets volumes for bond auctions.</title>
<headline>Spanish Treasury sets volumes for bond auctions.</headline>
<text>
<p>MADRID, June 2 Reuter) - The Bank of Spain announced  BANDF the following expected volumes and maximum amounts (in billions of pesetas) to be placed at auctions on Tuesday and Wednesday.</p>
<p>ISSUE	   Expected amount   Maximum amount     Auction date</p>
<p>3 and 10-yr	275		   325		 June 3</p>
<p>5 and 15-yr	175		   225		 June 4</p>
<p>NOTE - The announcement follows a Treasury decision to amend procedure for auctions, setting expected and maximum volumes to be placed in prior consultation with market makers.</p>
<p>Previous May auction</p>
<p>ISSUE	  Expected	Maximum  allotted     Auction date</p>
<p>3 and 10-yr	300	 375	  374.25		May 6</p>
<p>5 and 15-yr	185	 225	  196.01		May 7</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
